This repository is multi-licensed. Different file types are governed
by different SPDX-identified licenses, chosen to match the norms of
each content type:

  • Manuscripts, prose, audit deliverables (.md, .tex, .pdf, plain
    prose) — Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
    (CC BY-SA 4.0). Copyleft: derivatives must also be CC BY-SA 4.0.
    Canonical text: LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt

  • Code (.py, .sh, .ipynb, Makefile, CI workflows) — GNU General
    Public License version 3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later). Copyleft:
    derivatives that link or integrate this code must release source
    under GPL-3.0-or-later.
    Canonical text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt

  • Numerical outputs and fact tables (.csv, .json, CODATA-derived
    values) — Creative Commons Zero 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0). Public-
    domain dedication.
    Canonical text: LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt

The machine-readable mapping of every file in the repository to its
license is in REUSE.toml. The project follows the REUSE specification
(https://reuse.software).

For the author's assertion of original contributions, attribution
expectations, AI/ML training notice, and priority record, see
NOTICE.

For contributor licensing terms (inbound = outbound, DCO sign-off),
see CONTRIBUTING.md.


